ll\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"n1-maths-02\",\n    \"gradeband\": \"nursery1\",\n    \"subject\": \"Mathematics\",\n    \"subjectHa\": \"Lissafi\",\n    \"moduleNumber\": 2,\n    \"titleEn\": \"Writing 1–5\",\n    \"titleHa\": \"Rubuta 1–5\",\n    \"titleAjami\": \"رُﺑُتَ ١–٥\",\n    \"ajami_validated\": false,\n    \"textExplanationHa\": \"Rubuta lambobi yana nufin zana su a takarda. A wannan darasi, za mu koyi rubuta lambobi daga ɗaya zuwa biyar. Fara da lamba ɗaya – zana sanda tsaye guda ɗaya. Biyu – kamar wuyan agwagwa. Uku – lambobi uku suna da kurvature biyu. Huɗu – kamar sararin samaniya da sanda. Biyar – kamar 'S' mai tudun kai. Ka yi amfani da yatsa ka bi hanyar rubutu.\",\n    \"textExplanationAjami\": null,\n    \"audioScript\": \"[INTRO] Yau zamu rubuta lambobi 1-5. [MAIN] Lamba 1: sanda tsaye. Ka zana. Lamba 2: wuyan agwagwa. Ka zana. Lamba 3: kurvature biyu. Ka zana. Lamba 4: sanda da layi. Ka zana. Lamba 5: tudun kai da ciki. Ka zana. [PAUSE 1] Rubuta lamba 3 da kanka. [PAUSE 1 question] Ci gaba. Ka rubuta 1 zuwa 5 a jere. [PAUSE 2] Rubuta lamba 5. [PAUSE 2 question] [OUTRO] Aiki nagari! Yau ka koyi rubuta 1-5.\",\n    \"audioFile\": \"audio/n1-maths-02.mp3\",\n    \"imageCard\": \"images/n1-maths-02.webp\",\n    \"microPauses\": [\n      {\n        \"pauseAtMs\": 60000,\n        \"questionHa\": \"Lamba nawa ake rubuta kamar sanda tsaye?\",\n        \"correctAnswer\": \"ɗaya\",\n        \"options\": [\n          \"ɗaya\",\n          \"biyu\",\n          \"uku\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"pauseAtMs\": 120000,\n        \"questionHa\": \"Rubuta lamba biyu kamar me?\",\n        \"correctAnswer\": \"wuyan agwagwa\",\n        \"options\": [\n          \"wuyan agwagwa\",\n          \"kunne\",\n          \"tuta\"\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"quizQuestions\": [\n      {\n        \"templateHa\": \"Rubuta lamba {a}. Wace lamba ce?\",\n        \"answerFormula\": \"a\",\n        \"variableRanges\": {\n          \"a\": {\n         